# Local-only overrides — copy to .env and fill in real values.
# Nothing here is ever committed (.env is gitignored). This project needs
# zero secrets for cloud runs (GITHUB_TOKEN only); only local-only tools
# (Nano SSH key paths, local debug flags) belong here if ever needed.
# Example:
# MIFRAT_DEBUG=0

# Verified AI extraction (python -m scraper.extract). Free Gemini tier:
# MIFRAT_EXTRACT_BACKEND=gemini
# GOOGLE_KEY=your-key-here
# or Claude: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your-key-here
# The free tier's quota differs per model. If gemini-3.5-flash stops early with a
# per-day 429, try another model without changing code:
# MIFRAT_EXTRACT_MODEL=gemini-3.1-flash-lite
